OL,3,GNEWSAAI child sex abuse images rise
OL,4,Asharply, says IWF
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Internet Watch Foundation (IWF) has
OL,7,Fsaid its analysts have seen a massive
OL,8,Fincrease in AI-generated child sexual
OL,9,Fabuse material this year.
OL,11,FIts head of hotline Ngaire Alexander
OL,12,Fsaid this material tends to be at the
OL,13,Fmore severe end of the scale because
OL,14,F"people can create whatever they want".
OL,16,FThe charity, based in Histon,
OL,17,FCambridgeshire, reported 300,000
OL,18,Finstances of child sexual abuse online
OL,19,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
