OL,3,GNEWSAAI child sex abuse images rise
OL,4,Asharply, says IWF
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're also seeing people paying for
OL,7,Fthe tools or paying other people to
OL,8,Fcreate the content they want to see...
OL,9,Fwhich is really, really alarming," said
OL,10,FAlexander, a former police officer.
